{"product_id":"caliburn-g3-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn G3 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn G3 refillable pods are designed for use with the Uwell Caliburn G3 vape kit. They can hold up to 2ml of e-liquid and you can pair them with any flavour or nicotine strength you like, so you can try different options and see what suits you best. The pods contain a built-in coil and are designed for MTL (Mouth To Lung) and RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2ml Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Filling\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL Vaping\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible With 50\/50 And High PG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Caliburn G3 pods feature an easy top-filling design, so you can refill them without even having to remove them from your device. To swap between an RDTL and MTL inhale, you can just switch between the 0.6 Ohm, 0.9 Ohm and 1.2 Ohm pods. When the built-in coil has burnt out, all you have to do is replace the entire pod, so no more fiddly coil changes. When it comes to choosing an e-liquid, we suggest pairing these pods with a 50% VG vape juice or higher PG option.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 x Uwell Caliburn G3 2ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.6 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492533815,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 0.6 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.9 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492566583,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 0.9 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.2 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41652492599351,"sku":"U Cali G3 Replace pods - 1.2 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-g3-replacement-pods-min.jpg?v=1746632970","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




